  triage:title "fresh_database_migrates_and_writer_lane_persists_a_diagnostic polls query() to a 2s deadline after an async try_send instead of using the diagnostic lane's own FIFO reply signal" ;
  triage:description "fenix reviewer-B (01M1S72R6GNBE5ZETPK6943JMX). crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/diagnostic_timeline.rs:161 fresh_database_migrates_and_writer_lane_persists_a_diagnostic: record_batch is try_send, then the test polls query() to a 2s deadline waiting for the async write to land. Redesign: the diagnostic lane is FIFO and Prune{reply} on the same channel waits for a reply; call prune(0) (or a test-only drain() op) after record_batch, then assert once with no polling loop." ;
